00:29:25.620 --> 00:29:26.280
alleviate that?

486
00:29:26.520 --> 00:29:28.900
Sure. So that is an example.

487
00:29:30.300 --> 00:29:34.280
What the existing framework does is it has multiple layers of structures

488
00:29:34.360 --> 00:29:37.540
that need to be applied in order for a concession to be delivered.

489
00:29:37.600 --> 00:29:41.260
So you've got conservation management plans, conservation boards.

