00:29:46.200 --> 00:29:49.480
what's happening at a place today, and they're all laddering up to a piece of

492
00:29:49.520 --> 00:29:51.940
legislation that's almost 40 years old.

493
00:29:52.240 --> 00:29:52.780
Yeah.

494
00:29:52.800 --> 00:29:54.940
And so the streamlining

495
00:29:55.840 --> 00:29:59.420
that will exist in here for concessions in particular will enable

496
00:29:59.500 --> 00:30:00.540
DOC to

497
00:30:01.900 --> 00:30:05.840
approach standard concessions, and also those concessions

498
00:30:05.940 --> 00:30:09.500
where they are with a reputable, well-known

499
00:30:10.280 --> 00:30:13.510
established tourism operator to be recognized.

500
00:30:14.300 --> 00:30:18.120
And so the challenge we've got in the way that it works currently is that there's

501
00:30:18.160 --> 00:30:21.520
no certainty or consistency in the way that it's applied.

502
00:30:21.530 --> 00:30:24.909
And so that's what we're hoping to change through this

503
00:30:24.980 --> 00:30:27.160
modernization of the legislation.

