these providers are a critical part of the system.

708
00:41:31.348 --> 00:41:34.588
The way that the concessions framework is currently applied to these

709
00:41:34.608 --> 00:41:38.368
organizations is inconsistent with the purpose of this part of the

710
00:41:38.488 --> 00:41:42.138
act and also with Parliament's original intent when the concessions

711
00:41:42.168 --> 00:41:45.978
regime was introduced through the 1996 Conservation

712
00:41:46.048 --> 00:41:46.788
Amendment Act,

713
00:41:47.608 --> 00:41:51.548
a very similar process to the one that we are in now.

714
00:41:51.588 --> 00:41:55.448
The purpose of the 1996 amendment was to create a consistent and rational

715
00:41:55.508 --> 00:41:58.848
