719
00:42:09.948 --> 00:42:13.728
Not-for-profit charitable organizations delivering outdoor education

720
00:42:13.788 --> 00:42:15.828
activities are not commercial businesses.

721
00:42:16.148 --> 00:42:19.988
They do not make a profit, and they do not receive gain or reward

722
00:42:20.088 --> 00:42:21.608
from public conservation land.

723
00:42:22.748 --> 00:42:26.548
We assert that Parliament did not set out to regulate charitable trusts

724
00:42:26.608 --> 00:42:30.478
taking students on their first overnight tramp, yet that is what has

725
00:42:30.508 --> 00:42:33.828
happened. The legislation that is intended to foster

726
00:42:33.868 --> 00:42:37.828
appreciation and enjoyment of New Zealand's wild places is instead making it

727
00:42:37.868 --> 00:42:41.668
harder for young New Zealanders to access, experience, and benefit from

728
