them. And this is something that we believe is

729
00:42:45.188 --> 00:42:47.268
deeply counterproductive.

730
00:42:48.788 --> 00:42:52.716
This committee has the opportunity to correct this through this bill The bill

731
00:42:52.856 --> 00:42:56.786
provides for the minister to classify activities as exempt from the concessions

732
